	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Congratulations on your promotion to vice governor-general, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Kanami spits out her felicitations the moment Elsa opens the door to her room.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Were you deceiving me this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Whatever could you be talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You promised that we'd fight the Republic together! That\nwe'd wait as long as it took for Onii-sama to come back!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The situation has changed.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ngh─!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Elsa calmly catches Kanami's upraised fist.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If anything happens to Onii-sama, I swear that I will avenge him.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Mark my words.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh dear, you never cease to say some terrifying things.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Perhaps you might benefit from a relaxing environment in which to convalesce?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Several Republican soldiers file into the Empress's chambers at Elsa's signal.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Where do you intend to take me?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Rest assured that compared to the Imperial Palace, it'll be somewhere you can lead a much more peaceful lifestyle.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The soldiers here will escort you. It'd be best to follow their lead.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I see. So that's how it is...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Kanami realizes she is being forced into another gilded cage.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I beg your leave, Your Majesty, but I have other matters to attend to.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Elsa offers Empress Hisui a courteous farewell before turning to leave.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Only once the car carrying the Empress disappears into the distance does Elsa finally breathe a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You seem tired, vice governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Major Rochel. You've certainly moved up in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I never imagined that I'd receive an official commission.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's well-deserved in light of your accomplishments.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You monitored my every move and preempted the coup\nd'etat before it was too late.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, my accomplishments still pale in comparison to yours.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You completely subdued the warrior threat and brought peace to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Isn't that some shit.)”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Rochel still has yet to report Elsa's treason to Warren.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You stand atop the Empire in both name and fact. There's now nothing stopping you from making your ideals into reality.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“How nice of your father to hand you such a wonderful toy to play with.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Go ahead and instate the democracy you've always dreamed of!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I think I just might.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My first order of business: having you put into the ground!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Elsa furiously grabs him by the collar, dragging him close.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"But Rochel is completely unfazed, still wearing his amused smirk.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Don't be so hasty now, vice governor. I'm not the only one who knows about your little rebellion.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Is my life really worth losing everything you've worked up towards?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"At his spine-chilling whisper, Elsa relinquishes her grip.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What are you after?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"He is surely holding this over her so that he can take advantage of it at a later date.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"She needs to figure out what Rochel is planning, and soon.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nothing, really... Actually, if I had to say, status.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you saying that you want another promotion?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Yes, that's right.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Elsa's intuitions tell her that he's lying.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“By the way, have you managed to track down the ringleaders behind the coup d'etat yet?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They're the most wanted fugitives in the Empire. We're following up on every lead.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You're dealing with a warrior amongst warriors. Taking them in won't be easy.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm well aware of it.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Riiight, as I seem to recall, you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"were",
{"/font"},
" very familiar with him.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Elsa glares at Rochel as a wide grin spreads across his lips.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Would you consider putting me in charge of the manhunt for Miyaguni Akari and her warrior co-conspirator?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Just say the word, and I'll organize a task force right away and have them brought in posthaste.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“But of course. And naturally, I wouldn't dream of returning your dear former classmates to you as mincemeat.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"More than a few Republican soldiers harbor an intense personal hatred for the warriors. Perhaps Rochel is amongst them?",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Satisfied with this explanation, Elsa decides that leaving this to him is a reasonable recourse.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Realistically, with the situation in Tenkyo being as unstable as it is, it would be difficult for her to leave the city to pursue the fugitives herself.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Can I trust you to keep your promise?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You have my word.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well, Major Rochel. Your orders are to search for the ringleaders of the coup d'etat, Miyaguni Akari and her companions.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" use lethal force. I want them brought back to me alive.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Understood, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Rochel watches Elsa's back grow smaller and smaller into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"He smiles wryly at how easy it was to manipulate her.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Really, it's kind of disappointing.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Rochel-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"A woman─Yagi Sekka─appears before him, as though granted physical form by shadow itself.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Sekka, have you found them yet?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“No, I am afraid not...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Now that's a real problem... After all the trouble I went to getting permission from Elsa and everything.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Sekka kneels to the ground and lowers her head.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I thought I was in good hands, leaving you to handle all the magicks, but perhaps I was mistaken...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Th-They are in Inner Iseya. I am certain of it.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“If you know that much, what might the hold-up be?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Inner Iseya is a fortress woven of protective magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“None but the highest orders of the priesthood are capable of traversing its fortifications.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Sekka's forehead is slick with a cold sweat.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“As I recall, though, it was your job to do just that. Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That is correct, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Sekka sinks into an even deeper bow.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“That said, it's not like anyone else would have any better luck, so I suppose I have no choice but to leave it to you.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I will open a path for you. I swear it.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Yeah, counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Rochel brushes off Sekka's devotion with a flippant wave of the hand.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Still, though... they really need to be waking up soon...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nothing to do with you.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, right. How's your investigation of the Shireiden coming along?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Nothing has been uncovered as of yet.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But surely, there cannot be nothing to be found there.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Good grief. Magicks sure are every bit as troublesome as they seem.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Welp, just keep at it, I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is this... the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"As I open my eyes, I find myself upon a familiar battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"All around me, Sworn Blades and Republican soldiers meet each other in a storm of sanguinary steel.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Ah, this is just a dream.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I'm dreaming about the events of Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"As proof, none of the combatants around me even acknowledge my existence.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"It's as though I've become a specter on this battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Did someone just call my name?",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I heed my instincts and head towards the direction of that voice.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I wander through the palace halls for some time before finally arriving at the base of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"There, I find Kotone confronting an unfamiliar woman wearing a Republican Army uniform.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Who could this person be?",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You know what happened, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“Oh? Know what exactly?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please do not feign ignorance.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I just came back from examining the locus of power. The ground was completely stained with blood.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“During the war, a unit of a hundred priestesses under the Exalt-Priestess should have been stationed there.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Where did they all go?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“They died. All of them except me.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“Where else do you think all that blood would've come from?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The sneer she directs at Kotone is as cold as ice.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then you were one of the priestesses present at the locus of power?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“Didn't I already say that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"everyone else",
{"/font"},
" died?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“For being the Exalt-Priestess, you're not the sharpest tool in the shed, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Name yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“Yagi Sekka.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yagi...?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Yagis are among the most eminent of all the priestly houses... Whyever would you be wearing a uniform of the Republic?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Obviously because I'm part of the Republican Army. You really are as dumb as you look.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“If you try my patience any more, I just might accidentally drop this...”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"The woman calling herself Sekka shows Kotone a honeyed smile as she takes out a jeweled orb the size of a fist.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-That is my predecessor's Artifact!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why do you─?!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I took it from her. Not like she has much use for it anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Sekka casually rolls the orb between her fingertips.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yagi Sekka-san, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Could it be that you are the one who killed...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Her death was such a load off my chest! It's just a shame that her parting gift ended up being so worthless.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The orb slips from Sekka's fingers.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Just as I think it's about to shatter─",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"It hovers in the air, suspended above the ground, emitting a bright glow.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Well, that aside...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"She stows the orb away before turning to glare at Kotone with cold eyes.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I thought I'd see for myself what the girl they chose as Exalt-Priestess is really capable of.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Humor me, won't you, Shiinoha Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Black flames swirl about Sekka's outstretched palm.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am reluctant to use my magicks in such a manner, but if this is your intention, you leave me no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Kotone begins chanting her invocation─",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"This is a dream.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I know that this is nothing but a dream, but still, I'm unable to dispel this terrible sense of dread.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Allow me to assist you!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hweh?!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"For the briefest of seconds, Kotone and I meet eyes.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"My consciousness is pulled back to reality.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"All that surrounds me are the familiar walls and ceiling of my room.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It really was just a dream.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"But what a mysterious dream it was.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Just as my dreams of Mitsurugi surely have meaning, this dream may hold special significance as well.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I'll make sure to ask Kotone about it tomorrow.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
